# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Session transcripts — NEVER commit these.
#
# Captured /v1/messages bodies contain whatever you were working on: source,
# paths, and everything you typed. dump-proxy.py writes them; they are inputs
# to the harness, not artifacts of it.
#
# A set of these was published here once. Eight had been silently replaced by
# an unrelated session after a proxy restart, and it went unnoticed until the
# token counts stopped matching. tools/pre-commit-guard.sh is the backstop for
# whatever these patterns miss.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
captures/
e1-dumps/
**/req-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].json
**/manifest.jsonl
*-dumps/
*transcript*
*session-capture*

# Model generations — quality.py output embeds full model responses
quality/
*-quality.json

# Derived caches — regenerate with tools/prefix.py
.token-cache/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.venv/

# Model weights (100+ GB) — see README
*.gguf

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.swp
